{"version":1,"content":"<p>今年1至9月，全國紀檢監察機關共接獲信訪舉報350.6萬件次，其中檢舉控告類信訪佔84.7萬件次。</p><p>而立案有80萬件，其中包括省部級及以上幹部73人、廳局級幹部4203人、鄉科級幹部11.4萬人，現任或原任村黨支部書記、村委會主任7.9萬人。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T02:14:00.531408+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T01:39:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T14:18:29.879728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T02:11:29.223280+00:00","content_hash":"906e9865ca2cb9dfd21ae4b4444f21c7d6d3d2d3e8a1201dc9adde277cea416f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}